{
  "algorithms": [
    {
      "id": "H-01",
      "mode": "rectangle_area",
      "title": "長方形の和集合面積",
      "header": "computational_geometry/rectangle_union.hpp",
      "doc": "computational_geometry/rectangle_area.md",
      "example": "geometry_extensions/rectangle_area.cpp",
      "api": "`exact::Rectangle{x1,y1,x2,y2}`、`rectangle_union_area`、`rectangle_union_measure`。",
      "condition": "座標はint64全域、戻り値はBigInt。閉矩形で、幅または高さ0は面積・周長とも寄与0。逆順座標は拒否。",
      "complexity": "O(n log n)回の整数演算、O(n)領域。BigIntのbit計算量は別。",
      "principle": "x方向に走査し、圧縮したy座標の被覆長を積分する。",
      "sample": {
        "rectangles": [
          [
            0,
            0,
            3,
            2
          ],
          [
            2,
            1,
            4,
            3
          ]
        ]
      },
      "output": "9\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "H-02",
      "mode": "rectangle_perimeter",
      "title": "長方形の和集合周長",
      "header": "computational_geometry/rectangle_union.hpp",
      "doc": "computational_geometry/rectangle_perimeter.md",
      "example": "geometry_extensions/rectangle_perimeter.cpp",
      "api": "`exact::rectangle_union_perimeter(rectangles)`、`rectangle_union_measure`。",
      "condition": "面積と同じ入力。同じxでは追加を削除より先に処理し、接する辺を内部境界として消す。",
      "complexity": "O(n log n)回の整数演算、O(n)領域。",
      "principle": "被覆の連結区間数から水平境界を、イベントでの被覆長変化から垂直境界を数える。",
      "sample": {
        "rectangles": [
          [
            0,
            0,
            3,
            2
          ],
          [
            2,
            1,
            4,
            3
          ]
        ]
      },
      "output": "14\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "H-03",
      "mode": "circle_tangents",
      "title": "円の接線",
      "header": "computational_geometry/circle_tangents.hpp",
      "doc": "computational_geometry/circle_tangents.md",
      "example": "geometry_extensions/circle_tangents.cpp",
      "api": "`floating::common_tangents(a,b,tol)`、`tangents_from_point(circle,p,tol)`。`CircleTangents{infinite,lines}`。",
      "condition": "線は単位normal・offset（normal·x=offset）と両円の接点を返す。接点が一致しても線を保持。同一点円も無限本。点円同士の異なる2点は1本。",
      "complexity": "O(1)。",
      "principle": "2円の半径差・半径和と中心間距離から接線の法線を求め、同じ直線を統合する。",
      "sample": {
        "circles": [
          [
            0,
            0,
            1
          ],
          [
            4,
            0,
            1
          ]
        ]
      },
      "output": "0 4\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "H-04",
      "mode": "triangle_centers",
      "title": "三角形の外接円・内接円・垂心",
      "header": "computational_geometry/triangle_centers.hpp",
      "doc": "computational_geometry/triangle_centers.md",
      "example": "geometry_extensions/triangle_centers.cpp",
      "api": "`floating::triangle_centers(a,b,c,tol)`、`circumcircle`、`incircle`、`orthocenter`。",
      "condition": "optional。Toleranceで面積0と判定した三角形はnullopt。中心一式は外接円・内接円・重心・垂心を保持。MECと外接円の計算を共有。",
      "complexity": "O(1)。",
      "principle": "外心は2本の垂直二等分線、内心は辺長の重み付き平均、垂心はA+B+C−2O。",
      "sample": {
        "points": [
          [
            0,
            0
          ],
          [
            4,
            0
          ],
          [
            0,
            3
          ]
        ]
      },
      "output": "2.5 1 0 0\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "H-05",
      "mode": "polygon_centroid",
      "title": "多角形の重心",
      "header": "computational_geometry/polygon_centroid.hpp",
      "doc": "computational_geometry/polygon_centroid.md",
      "example": "geometry_extensions/polygon_centroid.cpp",
      "api": "`rational::polygon_centroid`、`exact::polygon_centroid`、`floating::polygon_centroid`。",
      "condition": "単純な境界ring。CW/CCW可。面積0はnullopt。整数入力も結果は任意精度有理点。浮動版は先頭点を原点にして和を取る。",
      "complexity": "O(n)演算、O(1)追加領域（整数からの変換はO(n)）。",
      "principle": "有向辺ごとの外積で、原点との三角形の面積と重心を加重する。",
      "sample": {
        "points": [
          [
            0,
            0
          ],
          [
            4,
            0
          ],
          [
            4,
            2
          ],
          [
            0,
            2
          ]
        ]
      },
      "output": "2 1\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "H-06",
      "mode": "circle_polygon_area",
      "title": "円と多角形の共通部分面積",
      "header": "computational_geometry/circle_area.hpp",
      "doc": "computational_geometry/circle_polygon_area.md",
      "example": "geometry_extensions/circle_polygon_area.cpp",
      "api": "`floating::circle_polygon_intersection_area(circle,polygon)`。",
      "condition": "単純多角形、CW/CCW可、点円・面積0の領域は0。辺を円との交点で分割し、接触も扱う。穴はringごとの符号付き差を呼出側で合成する。",
      "complexity": "O(n)時間、1辺あたりO(1)追加領域。",
      "principle": "円内の部分は三角形の外積、円外はatan2による扇形の境界積分に置き換える。",
      "sample": {
        "circle": [
          0,
          0,
          1
        ],
        "points": [
          [
            -2,
            -2
          ],
          [
            2,
            -2
          ],
          [
            2,
            2
          ],
          [
            -2,
            2
          ]
        ]
      },
      "output": "1\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "H-07",
      "mode": "circle_intersection_area",
      "title": "2円の共通部分面積",
      "header": "computational_geometry/circle_area.hpp",
      "doc": "computational_geometry/circle_intersection_area.md",
      "example": "geometry_extensions/circle_intersection_area.cpp",
      "api": "`floating::circle_intersection_area(a,b)`。",
      "condition": "包含・内外接・同一円・点円を処理し、非負面積を返す。有限の尺度で使用する。",
      "complexity": "O(1)。",
      "principle": "重なる2つの円弧から、扇形と三角形の差を足す。",
      "sample": {
        "circles": [
          [
            0,
            0,
            1
          ],
          [
            0,
            0,
            1
          ]
        ]
      },
      "output": "1\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "H-08",
      "mode": "circle_union_area",
      "title": "円の和集合面積",
      "header": "computational_geometry/circle_area.hpp",
      "doc": "computational_geometry/circle_union_area.md",
      "example": "geometry_extensions/circle_union_area.cpp",
      "api": "`floating::circle_union_area(circles)`。",
      "condition": "点円は寄与0、完全に同じ円は一度だけ数える。包含・交差・接触を扱う。分類は実際のlong double比較で、Toleranceによる近似同一視はしない。",
      "complexity": "O(n² log n)時間、O(n)追加領域。",
      "principle": "他の円に覆われる角度区間を統合し、露出する円弧の境界積分を足す。",
      "sample": {
        "circles": [
          [
            0,
            0,
            1
          ],
          [
            4,
            0,
            1
          ]
        ]
      },
      "output": "2\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "H-09",
      "mode": "planar_embedding",
      "title": "平面埋め込みの面列挙・双対",
      "header": "computational_geometry/planar_embedding.hpp",
      "doc": "computational_geometry/planar_embedding.md",
      "example": "geometry_extensions/planar_embedding.cpp",
      "api": "`rational::planar_embedding(vertices,edges,check=true)`、`planar_embedding(arrangement)`。",
      "condition": "直線辺の交差は分割済み、同一座標頂点・自己辺・重複辺は禁止。half_edgesにfrom/to/twin/next/face。faces[0]が唯一の外面。穴・橋・孤立点・非連結成分を同じ面へまとめる。双対は橋のloopと平行辺を保持。外面のareaは0。",
      "complexity": "E辺・V頂点でO((E+V) log(E+V+1)+E²+VE)演算、O(E+V)領域。検査を省略しても面包含の費用は残る。",
      "principle": "偏角順のhalf-edgeを左側の面に沿って歩き、負向き境界を包含する最小の正向き境界へ所属させる。",
      "sample": {
        "points": [
          [
            0,
            0
          ],
          [
            6,
            0
          ],
          [
            6,
            6
          ],
          [
            0,
            6
          ],
          [
            2,
            2
          ],
          [
            4,
            2
          ],
          [
            4,
            4
          ],
          [
            2,
            4
          ]
        ],
        "edges": [
          [
            0,
            1
          ],
          [
            1,
            2
          ],
          [
            2,
            3
          ],
          [
            3,
            0
          ],
          [
            4,
            5
          ],
          [
            5,
            6
          ],
          [
            6,
            7
          ],
          [
            7,
            4
          ]
        ]
      },
      "output": "3 8\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "H-10",
      "mode": "rational_lattice",
      "title": "有理凸領域の格子点・整数凸包",
      "header": "computational_geometry/rational_lattice.hpp",
      "doc": "computational_geometry/rational_lattice.md",
      "example": "geometry_extensions/rational_lattice.cpp",
      "api": "`rational::count_lattice_points(points)`、`integer_hull(points,max_columns=1000000)`。",
      "condition": "ユーザー承認済みの有理凸領域。点集合を凸包に正規化し、境界込み。空・点・線分も扱う。計数結果BigInt。整数凸包だけは整数x列を走査し、予算超過をlength_errorで拒否する。",
      "complexity": "頂点n、floor-sumのEuclid反復数Lとして計数O(n²+nL)。整数凸包は走査列WでO(n²+W log(W+1))、O(n+W)領域。bit計算量は別。",
      "principle": "上下境界の一次式にfloor-sumを適用する。整数凸包は各整数x列の最下端・最上端だけを凸包へ入れる。",
      "sample": {
        "points": [
          [
            0,
            0
          ],
          [
            3,
            0
          ],
          [
            3,
            2
          ],
          [
            0,
            2
          ]
        ]
      },
      "output": "12 4\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "H-11",
      "mode": "origin_rectangle_union",
      "title": "原点共有矩形の増分和集合",
      "header": "computational_geometry/origin_rectangle_union.hpp",
      "doc": "computational_geometry/origin_rectangle_union.md",
      "example": "geometry_extensions/origin_rectangle_union.cpp",
      "api": "`exact::OriginRectangleUnion`、`insert(x,y)`、`area()`、`skyline()`。",
      "condition": "[0,x]×[0,y]、x/yは非負int64。追加のみ、重複可。areaはBigInt。一般矩形の任意追加・削除を扱うAPIではない。",
      "complexity": "k個のskyline頂点を削除する追加O(log n+k)、m追加合計O(m log m)、O(m)領域。",
      "principle": "x昇順・高さ降順のskylineをmapで保持し、新しい矩形に隠れた角を削除する。",
      "sample": {
        "rectangles": [
          [
            2,
            3
          ],
          [
            4,
            1
          ],
          [
            3,
            2
          ]
        ]
      },
      "output": "6 8 9 \n"
    },
    {
      "id": "H-12",
      "mode": "segment_arrangement",
      "title": "線分sweep・交点列挙・Arrangement",
      "header": "computational_geometry/segment_arrangement.hpp",
      "doc": "computational_geometry/segment_arrangement.md",
      "example": "geometry_extensions/segment_arrangement.cpp",
      "api": "`rational::any_segment_intersection`、`segment_intersections`、`segment_arrangement`。",
      "condition": "点線分・端点接触・共線重複・多重点を含む。交差pairは点1個または重複区間の両端2個。Arrangementは幾何辺を統合し、元線分ID一覧を保持する。max_pairs=2000000、max_candidates=20000000で明示予算。",
      "complexity": "bounding-box sweepはO(n log n+C)、Cはx区間が重なる候補対数、最悪O(n²)。分割点・辺の整列はO((n+K)log(n+K))。Bentley–Ottmannの出力依存上界は主張しない。",
      "principle": "x区間の開始・終了で候補を絞り、厳密な交点で全線分を分割して重複辺をまとめる。",
      "sample": {
        "segments": [
          [
            [
              0,
              0
            ],
            [
              4,
              4
            ]
          ],
          [
            [
              0,
              4
            ],
            [
              4,
              0
            ]
          ],
          [
            [
              0,
              2
            ],
            [
              4,
              2
            ]
          ]
        ]
      },
      "output": "7 6\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "H-13",
      "mode": "convex_polygon_intersection",
      "title": "凸多角形の共通部分",
      "header": "computational_geometry/convex_polygon_intersection.hpp",
      "doc": "computational_geometry/convex_polygon_intersection.md",
      "example": "geometry_extensions/convex_polygon_intersection.cpp",
      "api": "`rational::convex_polygon_intersection(a,b)`。",
      "condition": "入力の凸頂点集合をstrict CCWへ正規化する。戻り値は空・一点・線分・凸多角形を区別できる頂点列。整数・旧128bit有理点はrational::Pointへ明示変換できる。",
      "complexity": "入力n,mの凸包構築を含めO(n log n+m log m+nm)、O(n+m)追加領域。",
      "principle": "片方の各辺の左側で他方を切断し、点・線分に退化した交差も厳密に残す。",
      "sample": {
        "a": [
          [
            0,
            0
          ],
          [
            3,
            0
          ],
          [
            3,
            3
          ],
          [
            0,
            3
          ]
        ],
        "b": [
          [
            2,
            -1
          ],
          [
            4,
            -1
          ],
          [
            4,
            2
          ],
          [
            2,
            2
          ]
        ]
      },
      "output": "4 2\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "H-14",
      "mode": "robust_predicates",
      "title": "適応精度・厳密幾何判定",
      "header": "computational_geometry/robust_predicates.hpp",
      "doc": "computational_geometry/robust_predicates.md",
      "example": "geometry_extensions/robust_predicates.cpp",
      "api": "`robust::orientation`、`incircle`：exact::Point / floating::Point。`dyadic`、`exact_value`。",
      "condition": "整数はint64全域をBigIntへ拡張。浮動は実際に表現された有限radix-2 long doubleの値を判定する。外向きintervalで符号を確定できなければ厳密dyadic有理数へ切替。incircleはabcがCCWなら円内が正、CWなら逆。fast-math不可。",
      "complexity": "フィルタはO(1)、fallbackは座標の有効bit長に依存するBigInt/BigRational演算。",
      "principle": "符号が0を跨ぐかを外向きの区間演算で確かめ、不確かな場合だけ全bitを使う。",
      "sample": {
        "points": [
          [
            0,
            0
          ],
          [
            4,
            0
          ],
          [
            0,
            3
          ],
          [
            1,
            1
          ]
        ]
      },
      "output": "1 1\n"
    },
    {
