    {
      "id": "H-16",
      "mode": "convex_farthest_neighbors",
      "title": "凸多角形の全頂点の最遠点",
      "header": "computational_geometry/convex_farthest_neighbors.hpp",
      "doc": "computational_geometry/convex_farthest_neighbors.md",
      "example": "geometry_extensions/convex_farthest_neighbors.cpp",
      "api": "`exact::convex_farthest_neighbors(points)` → 各入力に`{index,squared_distance}`。",
      "condition": "点集合は重複なし・strict凸位置。入力順は任意、凸包へ正規化し元添字へ戻す。空可、一点は自分。等距離のどれか1点を返し、全tie列挙はしない。距離はBigInt。",
      "complexity": "正規化と単調行最大値探索でO(n log n)演算、O(n)領域。",
      "principle": "凸包上の最遠点添字の巡回単調性を使い、行最大値を分割統治で求める。",
